cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use easyLSEA, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "easyLSEA: Biology-Aware Lipid Set Enrichment Analysis"
version: 0.1.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20341372
date-released: 2026-05-22
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Guardamino Ojeda
    given-names: David
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3122-2218"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DavidGO464/easyLSEA"
abstract: >
  easyLSEA provides biology-aware lipid set enrichment analysis (LSEA)
  for untargeted lipidomics data using dual engines: the
  Kolmogorov-Smirnov test and the fast gene set enrichment algorithm
  (fgsea). Includes lipid class annotation, fatty acid chain analysis,
  and export utilities for reproducible reporting.
keywords:
  - lipidomics
  - enrichment analysis
  - R package
  - lipid set enrichment
  - bioinformatics
